You: You approach a flamboyantly dressed youth carrying an empty tray. They smile and pause when you step over.
Waiter: "Can I help you, honored guest?" 
- "What is this place? What's going on here?" 
Waiter: "Honored guest must be new!" They give a brilliant grin and bow. "Welcome to the Butterfly Courtyard, where mages of all sorts are free to gather and talk." They wave an arm, encompasing the whole garden. "Feel free to relax and mingle."
=> END